bing soil structure.','Soil','http://vocabulary.odm2.org/taxonomicclassifiertype/soilStructure'),('soilTexture','Soil texture','A taxonomy containing terms describing soil texture.','Soil','http://vocabulary.odm2.org/taxonomicclassifiertype/soilTexture'),('waterQuality','Water quality','A taxonomy containing terms associated with water quality variables or processes.',NULL,'http://vocabulary.odm2.org/taxonomicclassifiertype/waterQuality');
